**DIRAC
.TITLE
  MgF
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
.ANALYZE
.4INDEX
.PROPERTIES
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
1
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
2
.INTFLG
1 1 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF
.CLOSED SHELL
20  
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0D-8  1.0D-6
#################################################
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
1..28
**PROPERTIES
! density at the nuclei
.RHONUC
*EXPECTATION
.ORBANA
**MOLTRA
.SCHEME
6
# pick up only the valence  open-shell spinor of interest
.ACTIVE
11
.PRPTRA
*PRPTRA
# we need this print level to get matrix elements
.PRINT
3
# comfactor is ...
# factor that originates ...
.OPERATOR
 'PVC F' 
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCF  01'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0
.OPERATOR
 'PVC F'
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCF  01'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0 
.OPERATOR
 'PVC F'
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCF  01'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0 
# ...
.OPERATOR
 'PVC Mg' 
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCMg 02'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0 
.OPERATOR
 'PVC Mg'
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCMg 02'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0 
.OPERATOR
 'PVC Mg'
 DIAGONAL
 'PVCMg 02'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D0 
*END OF
